			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "Docker deployments can override workspace OIDC settings with the following environment variables. At minimum, enable OIDC, select a provider, and set the client ID. Configure the remaining variables as required by the provider, callback, and access policy."
				}
			]
		},
