			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "Environment variables take effect when the kernel starts. A remote Docker deployment must also retain a browser lock screen password, a valid OIDC configuration, or an explicit authentication bypass. Otherwise, SiYuan refuses to start to avoid exposing the workspace without authentication."
				}
			]
		},
